# SARsight: 4D Surface Dynamics & Intelligence Platform

## 1. System Architecture Overview

**SARsight** is a dual-interface 4D geospatial platform that pairs an Action & Impact Dashboard with an interactive 3D Digital Globe. The platform ingests NASA-ISRO SAR (NISAR) Level-2 geocoded products to translate complex microwave signals into actionable intelligence for global sectors and emergency responders.

Leveraging the SweepSAR technique (>240 km imaging swath) and a 12-day exact repeat orbit, SARsight continuously monitors Earth's land and ice-covered surfaces.

